            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 1.0.15

- Added IDE handoff profiles for Codex in VS Code and Claude Code in VS Code.
- NHI delegations created from a detected IDE conversation now retain its provider and conversation ID, so self-delegated work can return to that conversation.
- Claude Code opens the linked session with the NHI briefing prefilled; Codex opens the linked thread and receives the same briefing through the clipboard until its extension exposes a public text-insertion API.

]]></description>
